   "npc": "3230",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Troll",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Mind yourself in the presence of the Warchief, $c. The Kor'kron will suffer no insolence or insult here.",
   "time": 1791750579,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3293|5bfb096f": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Rezlak",
   "npc": "3293",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Troll",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I'm happy Gazlowe gave me the opportunity to be here and all, but this place is more dangerous than I thought it'd be. It's also really hot. And dusty. And it smells kinda weird. Ah, well! Hopefully it will be good for business.",
   "time": 1791681211,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "4949|9a2b62b8": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Thrall",
   "npc": "4949",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Troll",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $N. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.\n\nIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.\n\nUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill.",
   "time": 1791750591,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "5811|aea93ec3": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Kamari",
   "npc": "5811",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Troll",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?",
   "time": 1791749917,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
